---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" image="/images/mars.jpg">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-site-edit="about-page-eyebrow">About this journal</p>
      <h1 data-site-edit="about-page-title">为仍然好奇的人，记录仍未抵达的地方。</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="manifesto-row">
      <span data-site-edit="about-observe-index">01</span>
      <h2 data-site-edit="about-observe-title">观察，而不是追赶</h2>
      <p data-site-edit="about-observe-description">热点会迅速远去，真正值得写下的东西通常走得更慢。这份博客尝试保留问题，而不急于给出结论。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="manifesto-row">
      <span data-site-edit="about-explain-index">02</span>
      <h2 data-site-edit="about-explain-title">把复杂的事说清楚</h2>
      <p data-site-edit="about-explain-description">技术不是冷冰冰的名词集合。好的解释应该像一张航图，让人知道我们从哪里来，又可能去往哪里。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="manifesto-row">
      <span data-site-edit="about-open-index">03</span>
      <h2 data-site-edit="about-open-title">保持向未知开放</h2>
      <p data-site-edit="about-open-description">文章不是终稿，只是此刻的坐标。允许修正、允许重写，也允许在答案之外继续前进。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
